OL,3,GNEWSATeddy bear appeal launched for
OL,4,Achildren in care
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople across Plymouth are being asked
OL,7,Fto donate teddy bears to help comfort
OL,8,Fchildren entering care through a new
OL,9,Fcity-wide appeal.
OL,11,FFoster for Plymouth hopes to collect at
OL,12,Fleast 550 brand-new teddy bears and
OL,13,Fsoft toys by the end of November,
OL,14,Fenough for every child and young person
OL,15,Fcurrently looked after by the city
OL,16,Fcouncil to receive one.
OL,18,FThe bears will be collected and stored
OL,19,Fbefore being displayed in a special
OL,20,FBear Adoption Room, where children can
OL,21,Fchoose a teddy. Donors are also being
OL,22,Fasked to give each bear a name.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
