OL,3,GNEWSATeddy bear appeal launched for
OL,4,Achildren in care
OL,5,
OL,6,FChildren can often arrive in care
OL,7,Funexpectedly and with very few
OL,8,Fbelongings, according to Foster for
OL,9,FPlymouth, which said a teddy could
OL,10,Fprovide comfort and reassurance.
